/*
 * Implements validation for the `__pragma!vtable(C)` construct.
 *
 * This pragma retrieves the address of the vtable of a class, the constant an
 * instance of the class is allocated with. It lets a library allocate an
 * instance without calling a constructor, initializing its fields being then
 * the job of the library.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::pragma::vtable
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/pragma/vtable.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-10-25
